---

This package is a Dart/Flutter port of drawably (https://github.com/dwhitedeveloper/drawably,
MIT licensed): the geometry engine, layer definitions, tuned constants, and the
DrawkitPen typeface all derive from that project. The port preserves its
invariants — real widgets do the work, the pen is decoration, one seeded
mulberry32 stream, boil frames pre-generated, reduced motion respected.
